{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":" 阎文清大师现任河北队主教练，98年个人赛最后一轮只需顶和即可卫冕冠军，遗憾负于许银川，获得亚军。在布局方面阎大师造诣深厚，时有创新，被誉为“布局专家”。\r\n 黑方柳大华特大有“东方电脑”之美称，其盲棋绝技独步弈林，曾创造1对19的盲棋最高记录。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":" 急进中兵这一变例对攻激烈，变化极为复杂，为攻杀型选手所喜用。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2e3","comment":" 常见下法，也可考虑兵三进一，象3进5，兵五平四，形成另一格式，变化相对比直接进马要稳健。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g3","comment":" 黑方的主流选择，也有卒7平6，车8进8等下法。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3d5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c9e7","comment":" 在次序上作了改变，实战中黑方车8进8最为常见，以下红马八进七，象3进5，这一次序上的改变将带来怎样的不同，我们来看双方的实战。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d5c7","comment":" 如马八进七，黑方车8进8即可还原流行格式，除此黑方还可以考虑马7进8，车四平三，卒5进1，以下红方马六进七，马8退9还原实战；红车三进二，则马8退6，黑可先弃后取，由此可看出次序上的区别。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":" 黑方也可考虑车1平3，马七退五，车8进8，以下红如接走马八进七，黑有马7进8，卒3进1，车3平4等多种选择，均形成复杂的对杀局面。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g3","comment":"","